## What is not, and why

The other 67 skills, the nine plugin directories, `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`,
the `/slash` commands and the README: a packaging surface this repository does not
use, and 67 bodies no tezgah task routes to. The two vendored here are exactly the
ones `skills/product-analysis/SKILL.md` defers to for the PE and PM axes; anything
else is one URL away and stays that way.

## The only modification

None. Both files keep their upstream bytes, frontmatter and description included.
`skills/pm-frameworks/SKILL.md` is tezgah's own entry point and is not part of the
manifest, the same way `skills/ai-research/SKILL.md` is not.

## Re-vendoring

Re-run the two `curl` fetches against the new revision, replace the table's sha256
and line counts, and update the revision in the first paragraph - all in one
commit. `tests/test_skills.py` fails on a body that no longer matches its hash, on
a listed file that is missing, and on an unlisted file beside them, so a re-vendor
that updates only the files is caught.
